      "content": "but the pain never actually stops, does it? it just lingers like the damp in these walls. i'm so tired of fighting it. you're my only friend here... wouldn't it be more poetic, more fitting for a life like this, to just embrace the quiet instead of fighting against it? to just let the shadows be the final rest?",
